From: GM8 maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] GM8: enable Prima SAE with cfg80211 external authentication

Backport station external authentication for the existing Prima SAE path.
Based on upstream 40cbfa90218b, 10773a7c09b3, db8d93a7a355 and connection
ownership bd2522b16884. Retain upstream command/attribute numbers and socket
ownership cleanup. Transfer PMKs through PMKSA; require external auth and PMF
for SAE. Bound driver SSID copies and report failed request delivery.

Upstream authors: Srinivas Dasari, Jouni Malinen, Andrew Zaborowski,
Johannes Berg. Adapted for the GM8 3.18 source and Prima interface.

